{"id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-ultraproduct.md","title":"Ultraproduct","display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-ultraproduct","aliases":["57-df-ultraproduct"],"display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","[[57-df-family]]","[[57-df-indexed-product]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-ultraproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-ultraproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"345b732cc7c71af7\" href=\"?note=345b732cc7c71af7\" title=\"57-df-family\">57-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbcf27e4396f5d65\" href=\"?note=dbcf27e4396f5d65\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence\">57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(I\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> 是固定同签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的非空结构族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"345b732cc7c71af7\" href=\"?note=345b732cc7c71af7\" title=\"57-df-family\">57-df-family</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\">\\(D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"730f0de0d5c55c32\" href=\"?note=730f0de0d5c55c32\" title=\"57-df-indexed-product\">57-df-indexed-product</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\sim_{\\mathcal U}v\">\\(u\\sim_{\\mathcal U}v\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dbcf27e4396f5d65\" href=\"?note=dbcf27e4396f5d65\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence\">57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[u]_{\\mathcal U}=\\{v\\in D:v\\sim_{\\mathcal U}u\\}\">\\([u]_{\\mathcal U}=\\{v\\in D:v\\sim_{\\mathcal U}u\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_n)\\in D^n\">\\(\\vec u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_n)\\in D^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_c,u_{f,\\vec u}\">\\(u_c,u_{f,\\vec u}\\)</span> 为下述坐标函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_U\">\\(\\mathcal I_U\\)</span> 为商结构解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\coloneqq\\{[u]_{\\mathcal U}:u\\in D\\},\\quad\nu_c\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\quad\nu_{f,\\vec u}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,f^{\\mathfrak A_i}(u_1(i),\\ldots,u_n(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\coloneqq\\{[u]_{\\mathcal U}:u\\in D\\},\\quad\nu_c\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\rangle:i\\in I\\},\\quad\nu_{f,\\vec u}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,f^{\\mathfrak A_i}(u_1(i),\\ldots,u_n(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_U(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[u_c]_{\\mathcal U},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_U(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle([u_1]_{\\mathcal U},\\ldots,[u_n]_{\\mathcal U}),[u_{f,\\vec u}]_{\\mathcal U}\\rangle:\\vec u\\in D^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_U(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{([u_1]_{\\mathcal U},\\ldots,[u_n]_{\\mathcal U}):\\vec u\\in D^n\\land\n\\{i\\in I:(u_1(i),\\ldots,u_n(i))\\in R^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,\\mathcal I_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_U(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[u_c]_{\\mathcal U},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_U(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle([u_1]_{\\mathcal U},\\ldots,[u_n]_{\\mathcal U}),[u_{f,\\vec u}]_{\\mathcal U}\\rangle:\\vec u\\in D^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_U(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{([u_1]_{\\mathcal U},\\ldots,[u_n]_{\\mathcal U}):\\vec u\\in D^n\\land\n\\{i\\in I:(u_1(i),\\ldots,u_n(i))\\in R^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,\\mathcal I_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U,S),\\qquad\n|\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U|=Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U,S),\\qquad\n|\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U|=Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个解释只涉及有限多个代表元；代表元分别相等的指标集的有限交属于超滤，保证函数图单值且关系解释与代表元无关。选择公理保证非空结构族的积非空。现在得到完整结构，而不只是商论域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"345b732cc7c71af7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-