cal I_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U,S),\\qquad\n|\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/\\mathcal U|=Q.","display":true}],"bytes":2099,"backlinks":[{"id":"f71aeba7a1e4b877","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。"},{"id":"978d6778ed6670d7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c01dc45d7752c583","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景 ZFC。$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i$ 为同签名结构族；全部解释见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，其自由变量依固定次序恰为 $x_1,\\ldots,x_n$，$n\\geq0$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$f_j\\in\\prod_i|\\mathfrak A_i|$，$[f_j]=[f_j]_{\\mathcal U}$；参数列满足记号见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-con